  _speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5b0efb9ebf8804f39a64eb09f5e67af0, type: 2}
  _lines:
  - She wandered in here while on her work trip.
  - She appears to be having an allergic reaction of some sort.
  - Tired and lifeless... I was going to feed her to my children.
  - But you're quite spirited... I'm sure you're about to tell me you're going to
    save her with the power of paperwork, or perhaps a slipper.
  _options:
  - _optionText: ((I got one better...))
